span","marks":[],"text":"သည် မြန်မာဟု မသုံးဘဲ ၎င်းတို့ထုံးတမ်းအခေါ်အဝေါ်အတိုင်း မြန်တျန့် (缅甸) ဟုသုံးသည်။ ဂျပန်နိုင်ငံသည် မြန်မာနိုင်ငံအား မြန်မာ (ミャンマー) ဟုခေါ်သော်လည်း မြန်မာလူမျိုးများအား ဘားမိစ် ("},{"_key":"ead8ca93a080","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"Burmese"},{"_key":"84bad83b1362","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":") (ビルマ人) ဟု ဆက်လက်သုံးစွဲသည်။ "},{"_key":"5e766dbfb78d","_type":"span","marks":["4b71f3186832"],"text":"ပြင်သစ်နိုင်ငံ"},{"_key":"7dcf79b15851","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"သည် အခြားနိုင်ငံအများစုကဲ့သို့ပင် ယခင်သုံးစွဲနေကျ ဘာသာပြန်ကိုသုံးပြီး မြန်မာပြည်ကို ဗိရ်မနီ ("},{"_key":"c0632a101d21","_type":"span","marks":["em"],"text":"Birmanie"},{"_key":"f312b427ac8b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":") ဟုခေါ်ကြသည်။"},{"_key":"fc27b1302d95","_type":"span","marks":["228485efdc9a"],"text":"[၂၈]"},{"_key":"1400ffe947f7","_type":"span","marks":["1e081e4b073d"],"text":"[၂၉]"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"84423c5be313","_type":"link","href":"https://my.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E1%80%80%E1%80%94%E1%80%B1%E1%80%92%E1%80%AB%E1%80%94%E1%80%AD%E1%80%AF%E1%80%84%E1%80%BA%E1%80%84%E1%80%B6"},{"_key":"2e81e9ea9951","_type":"link","href":"https://my.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E1%80%A9%E1%80%85%E1%80%90%E1%80%BC%E1%80%B1%E1%80%B8%E1%80%9C%E1%80%BB"},{"_key":"ad990a7be3c6","_type":"link","href":"https://my.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E1%80%A1%E1%80%99%E1%80%B1%E1%80%9B%E1%80%AD%E1%80%80"},{"_key":"4552c5c0a31d","_type":"link","href":"https://my.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E1%80%A1%E1%80%85%E1%80%AD%E1%80%AF%E1%80%B8%E1%80%9B"},{"_key":"bc0c711e4b8f","_type":"link","href":"https://my.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E1%80%99%E1%80%BC%E1%80%94%E1%80%BA%E1%80%99%E1%80%AC%E1%80%94%E1%80%AD%E1%80%AF%E1%80%84%E1%80%BA%E1%80%84%E1%80%B6#cite_note-statedept-24"},{"_key":"45f6e1c8c03d","_type":"link","href":"https://my.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E1%80%99%E1%80%BC%E1%80%94%E1%80%BA%E1%80%99%E1%80%AC%E1%80%94%E1%80%AD%E1%80%AF%E1%80%84%E1%80%BA%E1%80%84%E1%80%B6#cite_note-26"},{"_key":"e75855040f83","_type":"link","href":"htt